From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI_Lab <mia.ailab1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:00:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] server: TF_EXTRA_EOS, TF_THINK_OFF_SPLIT,
 TF_TOOL_CALL_GUARD and a log line for each rejected tool envelope

The 2x RTX PRO 6000 recipe's server patches, ported from TensorFold 1.3.0 to 1.3.5: extra end-of-sequence
strings, a thinking-off reply split at a stray think close, the opt-in guard against calls to unoffered tools,
and each rejected envelope logged with its reason (main's new malformed-call path included).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
